      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Adkerson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Adkerson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Adkerson has served as Chairman of the Board since 2021 and Chief Executive Officer since 2003. He has been a director of the company since 2006. He previously served as President from 2008 to 2021 and Chief Financial Officer from 2000 to 2003.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kathleen%20Quirk\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kathleen Quirk</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Quirk has served as President since 2021 and was appointed Chief Executive Officer effective June 2024. She previously served as Chief Financial Officer from 2003 to 2022 and has been with the company since 1989.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Marelee%20Felton\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Marelee Felton</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Felton has served as Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer since 2022. She previously served as Senior Vice President and Controller from 2013 to 2022.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Douglas%20Currault%20II\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Douglas Currault II</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President and General Counsel</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Currault has served as Senior Vice President and General Counsel since 2021. He joined the company in 2011 and has held various legal roles.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Andrew%20Langham\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Andrew Langham</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">General Counsel of Icahn Enterprises L.P.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Abney\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Abney</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Chairman and CEO of United Parcel Service, Inc. (UPS).</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dustan%20McCoy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dustan McCoy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Independent Director, Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of Brunswick Corporation. Lead Independent Director of FCX.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Frances%20Fragos%20Townsend\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Frances Fragos Townsend</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</sp